        "slc_d17caee47e32401450e17ec606f29ac0020331cacf32e5df01d6e4c71dbbfcb9"
      ],
      "text": "The kernel enforces hard budgets on reasoning iterations, tool calls, wall-clock time, context and result size; rejected calls still receive protocol-valid errors, and batches run concurrently only when entirely read-only."
    },
