        "slc_ac37be785f0a2f4fcd00c2a14ee1666085b4c73a24fe4902cb799051c264f2c8"
      ],
      "text": "Plan execution uses an atomic claim so only one executor runs a plan, checkpoints after each step, stops on failure marking remaining steps skipped, and returns idempotent responses for already-completed plans."
    },
